  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• In a medium bowl, combine garlic & herb seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil. Add plant-based crumbed chicken and toss to coat.\n• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat. Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6eeee28bb39b54068ca9/step-fbf2b6da.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Return frying pan to a medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook soffritto mix, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes. Add silverbeet and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add risoni and cook, stirring to coat, 1 minute.\n• Stir in passata, chicken-style stock powder, Italian herbs, the brown sugar and the boiling water (1 cup for 2 people / 2 cups for 4 people).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6eeee28bb39b54068ca9/step-1085728b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risoni mixture to the baking dish with the chicken. Cover tightly with foil.\n• Bake until liquid is absorbed and chicken is cooked through (when no longer pink inside), 25-30 minutes.\n• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Stir in the butter, plant-based chicken and shaved Parmesan cheese (reserve a pinch for the garnish!). Season to taste (add a dash more water if the risoni looks dry!).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6eeee28bb39b54068ca9/step-63ccaee7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Italian-style plant-based crumbed chicken risoni bake between plates.\n• Sprinkle with reserved Parmesan to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/646c6eeee28bb39b54068ca9/step-0969b902.jpg"
    }
  ]
